#doc(title: [Forces and motion#footnote[A note anchored in the title.]], subject: "A project without a stylesheet")

= Newton's laws#footnote[A note anchored in a heading.]

The base stylesheet alone sets this document: its lists, its figure and its notes.#footnote[A note anchored in body text, on the same page as the notes of the title and the heading.]

- a body at rest stays at rest;
  - unless a resultant force acts on it;
    - which is the first law.
- a body in motion keeps its velocity.

+ measure the mass;
  + with a balance;
    + zeroed first;
    + read at eye level.
  + or from the weight.
+ measure the acceleration.

